        "markdown": "# Lionel Appearance Grammar Study 02\n\n## Hosted Forensic Commentary\n\nA transcript-grounded map of a roughly 61-minute Sean Atwood-hosted appearance featuring Lionel.\n\n**Key distinction:** this is not structurally the same thing as Study 01's standalone thesis monologue.\n\n`HOST FRAME -> EXPERT AUDIT -> CASE EXPANSION -> CHARACTER CRITIQUE -> META-FRAME -> CROWD EVIDENCE -> HOST RESET -> QUALIFIED ANSWER -> SIGNOFF`\n\nObserve first. Compare later. Promote only what repeats.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786053587115,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
