        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-appearance-grammar-study-02"
        },
        "markdown": "# 📺 Source and Boundary\n\n**Source:** posted transcript supplied for Study 02.\n\n**Duration represented:** about 61:17.\n\n**Host:** Sean Atwood.\n\n**Guest:** Lionel.\n\nThe host introduces Lionel, plugs Lionel's channel and Candace Owens interview, and frames the discussion around Candace Owens, Charlie Kirk, Tyler Robinson, TPUSA, and alleged corruption. Lionel then takes control of the substantive discussion. \n\nLionel signs off around 59:27; Sean continues alone with channel programming until about 61:17. \n\n**Boundary note:** this is best treated as a Lionel guest appearance inside another show's container, not automatically as a Lionel-owned episode.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786053587115,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
