        "markdown": "# 1 · Host Frame and Rapport\n## 0:00–1:27\n\nSean opens the stream, welcomes Lionel back, promotes Lionel's recent Candace Owens interview, jokes about their chemistry, and names the subject cluster for the appearance. \n\n**Function:** establish host ownership of the container, guest identity, relationship tone, and discussion agenda before yielding the floor.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
