        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-appearance-grammar-study-02"
        },
        "markdown": "# 3 · Character and Motive Expansion\n## 21:09–32:22\n\nThe focus pivots from physical evidence to Erica Kirk, public grief, TPUSA behavior, personal stories, and the rhetorical protection afforded by the label “widow.” Lionel then brings Candace Owens back into the frame as the person challenging those narratives.  \n\n**Function:** move from forensic anomalies to judgments about people, credibility, performance, and institutional behavior.\n\n**Caution:** these are Lionel's interpretations and allegations in the transcript, not independently established findings.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786053587115,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
