        },
        "markdown": "# 4 · Rapport and Charisma Digression\n## 32:22–40:58\n\nThe live chat becomes visible in the conversation. Lionel jokes with Sean, praises Sean's audience relationship, and develops a long account of Candace's charisma, sincerity, and audience loyalty using pop-culture and food analogies.  \n\n**Function:** reinforce personality, friendship, audience intimacy, and the social credibility of the people involved.\n\nThis is not dead air. The digression appears to be part of the performance grammar.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786053587115,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
