        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-appearance-grammar-study-02"
        },
        "markdown": "# 8 · Host Reset and Qualified Answer\n## 55:30–58:48\n\nSean interrupts to “squeeze the question in before the hour” and asks who would have had a vested interest in Charlie Kirk's death, specifically raising Israel. Lionel discusses possibilities involving Israel, TPUSA, and political funding but repeatedly backs away from declaring responsibility and emphasizes uncertainty. \n\n**Function:** the host finally converts the sprawling commentary into a direct question; Lionel closes by marking an epistemic boundary: they do not yet know who was responsible.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
