        },
        "markdown": "# 9 · Dual Outro\n## 58:48–61:17\n\nSean plugs Lionel's channel and interview, Lionel thanks Sean and the audience, and they exchange a comic personal farewell. Lionel leaves around 59:27. Sean then performs his own host-only outro, previews upcoming guests and stories, and closes the stream. \n\n**Function:** reveal two ownership layers: **guest signoff** followed by **host channel maintenance**.",
