      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-appearance-grammar-study-02"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧱 Content Objects\n\nMajor subjects and referenced entities include:\n\n- Sean Atwood and Lionel\n- Candace Owens\n- Charlie Kirk\n- Tyler Robinson\n- Erica Kirk\n- TPUSA\n- rifle, ballistics, residue, wound and scene evidence\n- alleged confessions, messages and screenshots\n- courtroom images and vehicle evidence\n- online “deep divers” and audience researchers\n- Alex Jones and Laura Loomer\n- CIA/Warren Commission references\n- Israel, Benjamin Netanyahu and AIPAC\n- JFK, O.J. Simpson, Casey Anthony and Trayvon Martin analogies\n- live chat and both creators' audiences\n\nThese are **objects of discussion**. They should not automatically become Lionel segment classes.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786053587115,
