      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-appearance-grammar-study-02"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧪 Provisional Segment Types\n\nDo not promote these yet. Study 02 suggests:\n\n### Lionel-oriented\n1. **Lionel Audits Evidence**\n2. **Lionel Reenacts a Proof Test**\n3. **Lionel Recaps Anomalies**\n4. **Lionel Critiques Character or Motive**\n5. **Lionel Meta-Frames Inquiry**\n6. **Lionel Aggregates Independent Research**\n7. **Lionel Builds Rapport**\n8. **Lionel Qualifies a Theory**\n\n### Container-oriented\n9. **Host Introduces Lionel**\n10. **Host Redirects Lionel**\n11. **Guest Signoff**\n12. **Host Solo Outro**\n\nThis split may be crucial. Some node types describe **Lionel's rhetorical grammar**, while others belong to a reusable **hosted-appearance template**.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
